	(text "Pull-ups 10k (SD spec: 10-100k) on CMD and D0-D3. D3 doubles as\ncard detect in SPI mode; we use the socket's switch instead (DET -> P00).\nDET = the drawing's 'Cd' pad; it switches against the shell (GND).\nP00's internal pull-up (TCA9555) is the only pull-up. Polarity\n(closed with or without a card) isn't on the drawing: check at bring-up." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 266.7 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016) (italic yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5a12d540-8c18-5e0c-ae95-6d9d1165197a"))
